%!PS
% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% oracle: colour
% Scenario: an axial shading is accepted. Inside a rectangular clip,
% shfill paints a red-to-blue blend along a horizontal line, extended
% before its start; the page carries one shade operation of type 2 with
% those coordinates, function, and extension under the CTM at the
% call, and the current path and colour are left alone.
gsave
100 100 translate
0 0 200 100 rectclip
<< /ShadingType 2 /ColorSpace /DeviceRGB /Coords [0 0 100 0]
   /Function << /FunctionType 2 /Domain [0 1] /C0 [1 0 0] /C1 [0 0 1] /N 1 >>
   /Extend [true false] >> shfill
grestore
showpage
